<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:00:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>姆巴佩的道歉是一个警告：中国的经济胁迫需要集体回应</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/mbappes-apology-chinas-economic-coercion/</link><description>只要政府不对抗中国，任何公司或个人都不会——当然也不会是运动员，无论多么有名。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2285016491.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/mbappes-apology-chinas-economic-coercion/</guid></item><item><title>马来亚银行技术主管并不急于将代理人工智能摆在客户面前：“你不想让信任处于危险之中”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/maybank-pursuing-gradual-agentic-ai-rollout/</link><description>马来亚银行首席技术官 Giorgio Migliarina 表示，该银行希望人工智能代理在面向客户之前能够进行审计和预测。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55660309360_0ee14d2911_4k-e1795135067518.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:01:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/maybank-pursuing-gradual-agentic-ai-rollout/</guid></item><item><title>中国的大湾区是为了与硅谷竞争而建立的。近十年过去了，它终于不负众望了吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/china-greater-bay-area-finally-ready-hong-kong-shenzhen-macau/</link><description>大湾区正在开始兑现其承诺——尽管目前主要是香港和深圳的故事。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GBAA_Hong-Kong-Zhuhai-Macao-Bridge_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/china-greater-bay-area-finally-ready-hong-kong-shenzhen-macau/</guid></item><item><title>Sound Ventures 将 4.35 亿美元转为 Anthropic 价值 70 亿美元的股份。阿什顿·库彻 (Ashton Kutcher) 在 IPO 前几个月离开</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-sound-ventures-ashton-kutcher-7-billion-stake/</link><description>由 Guy Oseary 和 Ashton Kutcher 共同创立的 Sound Ventures 向 Anthropic 投资了约 4.35 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2257124859.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:22:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-sound-ventures-ashton-kutcher-7-billion-stake/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 的 IPO 为高盛和摩根士丹利各带来 1.13 亿美元的费用，超过了 SpaceX 的发薪日</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropics-ipo-nets-goldman-sachs-and-morgan-stanley-113-million-apiece-in-fees-eclipsing-their-spacex-paydays/</link><description>这一轰动的公开亮相带来了华尔街历史上最大的承销发薪日之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305196507-e1795128593757.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropics-ipo-nets-goldman-sachs-and-morgan-stanley-113-million-apiece-in-fees-eclipsing-their-spacex-paydays/</guid></item><item><title>“整个互联网立刻尖叫起来”：随着微软、美国联邦航空局、大通银行和苹果公司的宕机，DownDetector 一周内记录了 640 万份美国停电报告</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/outlook-faa-chase-crashed-down-detector-outages-ai-agents-hack/</link><description>DownDetector 的研究负责人认为“有点巧合”和下降的趋势。参议员马克·华纳 (Mark Warner) 将其归咎于急于修补软件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/flight-delays-board.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:17:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/outlook-faa-chase-crashed-down-detector-outages-ai-agents-hack/</guid></item><item><title>Anthrotic 股票在大型 IPO 中市值飙升 30% 至 2 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-first-day-trading-nasdaq-record-valuation/</link><description>它在华尔街的首次亮相立即使这家成立五年的人工智能公司跻身万亿美元上市公司的精英俱乐部。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305298299-e1795102326650.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:28:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-first-day-trading-nasdaq-record-valuation/</guid></item><item><title>英国和五角大楼告诉人们在十月份做好准备。现在 Costco 的发电机已售罄，亿万富翁们有“末日保险”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/costco-generators-sold-out-britain-pentagon-prepare-apocalypse-insurance/</link><description>一系列技术中断导致 Costco 会员囤积大米、水和发电机。采购活动在停电发生前几周就开始了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GettyImages-2236344475-e1758802471327.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:00:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/costco-generators-sold-out-britain-pentagon-prepare-apocalypse-insurance/</guid></item><item><title>“严格的手机禁令似乎可以堵住大约一半的漏洞”：哈佛大学经济学家发现锁住学生的手机每年可以增加 1-2 周的学习时间</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/harvard-phone-ban-study-school-kids-learn-two-weeks/</link><description>严格的育儿袋禁令每年可以恢复一到两周的学习时间，大约是自 2013 年以来美国学生每年损失的学习时间的一半。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2166466262-e1795038458269.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/harvard-phone-ban-study-school-kids-learn-two-weeks/</guid></item><item><title>Target 的扭亏为盈，在 3.01 亿美元的关税意外收入的帮助下，营业利润增长了 76%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/target-q3-booked-301-million-from-trump-tariff-refunds/</link><description>塔吉特的扭亏为盈得益于特朗普的关税，但由于其他投资，其利润无论如何都会增加。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2266349476-e1795104233533.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:53:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/target-q3-booked-301-million-from-trump-tariff-refunds/</guid></item></channel></rss>